    <rnb>85</rnb>
    <tib>rdo rje yangs rtog gi rgyud ces bya ba</tib>
    <skt>badzra ba ye ke tu h+ri da ya tan tra nA ma</skt>
    <coloph>gser la mthong sems mi bdog te/ /zong med lag tu gser mi 'khor/ /chos la mthong sems mi bdog te/ /snod med lag tu chos mi 'khor/ /don gyi snying po gsung rgyud 'di/ snying gi phug gtag tshig rgyud re/ /khong gi snying gton snying po rdo rje'i rgyud/ /yang rtse yang rtogs gdams pa'i ma bu rnams/ /snying gi snying gton snying po hu'M gi bskor/ /skal ldan skyo ngal med pa'i bu la gtod/ /kun gyi gzhi ma byed de nam mkhA khab mig 'dra/ sa ni gser gyi gzhi ma byed de rdo dang bshags mas bsgribs/ mig gis thams cad blta te rang ma mthong bas lan/ /snying po nyid dang rtag tu 'grogs te grub mthas bsgrib/ / e ma rang gis rang bslus rang ka snying re rje/ /shin tu dkon pa'i rin chen gser kyang byin pa'i sa rdo'o// //nor bu rin chen snying po ma bu gdams ngag rnams/ / /bzhag pa'i snod med sgro skur sgrib pa'i sa steng gsang/ ces pas pad+ma 'byung gnas kyis/ /namkha'i snying po la gdams nas/ lho nub kyi gling phran du gshegs so// //sarba mangga lam</coloph>
